{"id":"word:hebrew:H8081","type":"word","title":"שֶׁמֶן","subtitle":"H8081 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"grease , especially liquid (as from the olive, often perfumed); figuratively, richness","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שֶׁמֶן (H8081) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 193 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שֶׁמֶן (shemen) means grease , especially liquid (as from the olive, often perfumed); figuratively, richness First listed occurrence: 1Chr 9 29."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שֶׁמֶן","transliteration":"shemen","pronunciation":"sheh'-men","strong":"H8081","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8081","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["בַ/שֶּׁ֖מֶן","שֶׁ֣מֶן","וְ/שֶׁ֖מֶן","שָֽׁמֶן","בַ/שָּׁ֑מֶן"],"morphs":[["HRd/Ncmsa",50],["HNcmsa",33],["HTd/Ncmsa",28],["HNcmsc",24],["HC/Ncmsa",20],["HR/Ncmsc",8],["HR/Ncmsa",7],["HNcmpa",5],["HC/Ncmsc",4],["HC/R/Ncmsc/Sp3fs",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"grease , especially liquid (as from the olive, often perfumed); figuratively, richness","usage":"anointing, × fat (things), × fruitful, oil(-ed), ointment, olive, pine.","full":"H8081. shemen שֶׁ֫מֶן 192 noun masculine 2Kin 20:13 (on apparently feminine Song 1:3 compare Albr ZAW xvi (1896), 99, 106 ) fat, oil ; — ׳שׁ absolute Genesis 28:28 +, construct Lev 8:2 +; ׳שָׁ֑ 2Kin 4:6 +; suffix שַׁמְנִי Hosea 2:7 +, etc.; plural שְׁמָנִים Amos 6:6 +; suffix שְׁמָנֶיךָ Song 1:3 , נַיִח - 4:10 ; &#8212; 1 fat, fatness: בֶּןשֿׁ ׳קֶרֶן Isa 5:1 (of fertile slope); plural גֵּיאשְֿׁמָנִים 28:1 , 4 ; of food (in figurative) 25:6 (twice in verse); literal מִשָּׁ֑מֶן כָּחַשׁ כְּשָׂרִי Psa 109:24 (compare צוֺם v a ), compare שׁ ׳מִמְּנֵי Isa 10:27 (in figurative, si vera lectio, meaning obscure; most now emend by conjecture; RS JPH xili (1885), 62 שֹׁרֵד מִצָּפוֺן עָלָה [see also II. חבל ], joining to 10:28 ; Du Marti has gone up from Pene-Rimmon [??], compare Di-Kit). 2. a. oil , specifically olive-oil, as rich product Deut 8:8 + (see זַיִת ); hence שׁ ׳עֵץ Isa 41:19 oil-tree , usually explained as wild olive, oleaster, so Neh 8:15 (|| וַיִת ), שׁ ׳עֲצֵי oleaster-wood 1Kin 6:23 , 31 , 32 , 33 ; once ׳שׁ הַמֹּר Est 2:2 (see מֹר p. 600:b; ׳מ also in holy anointing oil Exod 30:23 ). b. ׳שׁ as staple (codiment) Num 11:8 (J; see לשׁד ), of value 1Kin 17:12 , 14 , 16 ; 2Kin 2:4 , 6 , 7 4 t.; symbol of plenty Deut 32:13 ; 33:24 ; Job 29:6 ; ascribed (fassely) to gift of Baals Hosea 2:7 ; as royal treasure 2Kin 20:13 = Isa 39:2 , compare 1 Kings 5:25 ( ׳שׁ תִית כָּ , see ׳כ ) = 2Chr 2:9 ; 2:14 3 t.; tribute Hosea 12:2 , article of trade Ezek 27:17 ; odoriferous Prov 27:9 ; Song 1:3 ; 4:10 , ׳שׁ רוֺקֵחַ Eccl 10:1 , so (figurative) Song 1:3 ; Eccl 7:1 ; Prov 27:16 is corrupt, see Toy; sign of luxury Ezek 16:13 ; Prov 21:17 , of prosperity Ezek 16:20 . c. ׳שׁ as medicament Isa 1:6 ; as unguent, for shield 2Sam 1:21 , person Amos 6:6 ; Micah 6:15 ; Deut 28:40 ; Ezek 16:9 ; Esther; Psa 92:11 ; 104:15 , not for mourner 2Sam 14:2 ; on head token of happiness Eccl 9:8 , of hospitality, בַּמֹּ ׳דִּמַּנְתָּ ראֹשִׁי Psa 23:5 (figurative), in simile 133:2 ; 141:5 . d. for anointing king , הַשּׂ ׳מַּח 1Sam 10:1 ; 2Kin 9:1 , 3 , compare 9:6 , with קֶרֶן 1Sam 16:1 , 13 ; 1Kin 1:39 ; compare ׳בְּשׁ מְשַׁחְתִּיו קָדְשִׁי Psa 89:21 . e. in various figs., of joy ׳שׁ שָׂשׂוֺן Isa 61:3 ; Psa 45:8 ; soft words 55:22 ; Prov 5:3 ; as penetrating Prov 109:18; as clear, transparent Ezek 32:14 . f. used in primitive worship, poured on stone Gen 28:18 (E), 35:14 (J). g. in later ritual: for anointing priests , tabernacle, altar utensils, etc. (P), made of various ingred., ׳שׁ וַיִת among them, Exod 30:24 , ׳שׁ הַמִּשְׁתָה 25:6 ; Lev 8:2 , 10 , 12 11 t.; ׳שׁ מִשְׁחַתקֹֿדֶשׁ Exod 30:25 (twice in verse) + 2t.; ׳שׁ ׳מ ׳י Lev 10:7 , ׳שׁ ׳מ אֱםהָיו 21:12 ; ׳שׁ ׳הקּ Num 35:25 ; ׳שׁ alone Lev 14:10 12 t. Leviticus 14; for lighting Exod 25:6 6 t. + ׳שׁ חִית כָּ זָח זַיִת 27:20 ; Lev 24:2 (see תִית כָּ ); poured upon מִנְחָה 2:1 5 t., compare 5:11 ; Num 5:15 ; smeared (see מָשַׁח ) upon wafers Exod 29:2 ; Lev 2:4 +, and cakes (or mixed in the making? compare בָּלַל ) Exod 29:2 ; Lev 2:4-5 , +, so בַּשׁ ׳סֹלֶת 2:7 etc. (c. 45 t. in all), שׁ לֶחֶם ׳חַלַּת Exod 29:23 ; Lev 8:26 . h. for use in temple 1Chr 9:29 . i. for תְּרוּמָה in Ezekiel's temple Ezek 45:14 (twice in verse) + 7 t. 45, 46. j. efficacy denied Micah 6:7 k. offered to idols Isa 57:9 ; Ezek 16:18-19 , 23:41 . &#8212; See Macalister Hast. DB OIL ARSK Ency. Bib. OIL .","rootNote":"from 8080 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 9 29","keyReferences":["1Chr 9 29","1Chr 12 41","1Chr 27 28","1Kgs 1 39","1Kgs 5 25","1Kgs 6 23","1Kgs 6 31","1Kgs 6 32"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":193,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 9 29","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/הַ/שֶּׁ֔מֶן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Td/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 41","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":41,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֶׁ֛מֶן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 27 28","book":"1Chr","chapter":27,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שֶּׁ֖מֶן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 39","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שֶּׁ֨מֶן֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 5 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֶׁ֣מֶן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 23","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שָׁ֑מֶן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 31","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שָׁ֑מֶן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 32","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֶׁמֶן֒","